# Product north star

**Canonical doc:** `docs/NORTHSTAR.md` · **UI strings:** `src/content/productNorthStar.ts`

## What UAE Trail is

Help people **find like-minded company outdoors** in the UAE & GCC — discover plans, connect, chat, **go together**.

## Who

Residents, expats, **tourists, visitors** — not “UAE locals only.”

## Activities

**Get outside** — hikes, camps, trail runs, jogs, group outings (examples, not limits).

## Copy lead

Emotion and togetherness first — *find your people · get outside · go together* — not map/host/join architecture.

## Before shipping user-facing copy

1. Read `docs/NORTHSTAR.md`  
2. Lead with the problem (loneliness, flaky plans, no crew) not features  
3. Mechanisms (map, hosts, requests) are *how*, not *why*
